-#### Combined ORB-SLAM + 3DGS
-This approach combines an existing frame-based tracking system (ORB-SLAM) with 3DGS mapping. ORB-SLAM recovers poses, and 3DGS is trained with poses and sensor depth of keyframes, equivalent to offline splatting [S2, unofficial]. On EuRoC Machine Hall (Stereo Depth), the ATE RMSE (m) for ORB-SLAM3 is 0.052, while the combined approach yields 3.190. Point-SLAM fails on all sequences [S2, unofficial]. While ORB-SLAM achieves the best ATE, the combined approach shows no significant difference in rendering metrics compared to unified 3DGS SLAM. The unified approach is preferred for exploring 3DGS throughout the entire algorithm [S2, unofficial].
